 The original by Michael Helsem from ''le pamai jbopemci cukta
 ci'a la maiky'elsym''

__le ROZgu .A lo ZGIke SEkai__
The rose,or a music with
__LEri KAzyXUNre ba LUNra__
its redness, will be lunar-
__XARnu nunDUNra RI'a .IA__
stubborn in its winterhood, because of (I believe)
__DO .e LEdo DARno LOGji__
you & your distant logic.

__.IseCU'u LE pu DO ku__
As said by you before,
__KO fi MI ca CUSku fe LEIva__
again say to me those
__SMAji VALsi NOI mi KE'a__
soft words that i
__puJEca .IEcai NAbo NATfe__
then & now--yes!--don't deny

__naMU'i ROlei JITfyCIPra__
in spite of all the disproofs...
